This project uses the separately downloaded DLSS-NR-on-AMD v0.2.10 runtime
by Daniel B. (https://github.com/danielblnc/DLSS-NR-on-AMD). That runtime
provides the neural graph and AMD kernels; it is not included in our source
or release. The NVIDIA model DLL and extracted model data are also excluded.

The launcher downloads unmodified, hash-pinned ROCm and support packages
directly from the SteamOS package mirror. Their original archives, including
license material, remain in the local download cache. No system packages
are installed. Runtime downloads remain subject to their upstream licenses.

The Windows bridge includes MinGW-w64 runtime code (see licenses/mingw-w64.txt)
and GCC runtime components under GPLv3 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception
3.1 (see licenses/gcc-runtime-exception.txt). The winpthreads runtime carries
the notices in licenses/winpthreads.txt. Build dependencies retain their
respective licenses. No association with NVIDIA, AMD, or Valve is implied.
